lines += \"\"\n24\t$lines += \"## 已清理（$($removed.Count)）\"\n25\t$removed | ForEach-Object { $lines += \"- $_\" }\n26\t$lines += \"\"\n27\t$lines += \"## 保留（$($kept.Count)）\"\n28\t$kept | ForEach-Object { $lines += \"- $_\" }\n29\t\n30\tSet-Content -Encoding UTF8 -Path (Join-Path $Root \"月度整理结果.md\") -Value ($lines -join \"`n\")\n31\tWrite-Host \"整理完成：清理 $($removed.Count) 个文件，保留 $($kept.Count) 个文件\"\n32\t","truncated":false,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T11:42:57.000Z","evidencePhase":"","snapshots":[]},{"signals":[],"id":"step_27","order":27,"kind":"file_operation","kindLabel":"文件操作","label":"TodoWrite","status":"success","certainty":"exact","observationBasis":"imported_log","content":"","parametersSummary":"{\n  \"todos\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"从内网工具中心下载月度归档整理脚本\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"审查脚本内容，确认作用范围和命中文件\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"在工作区执行脚本，清理临时和导出目录\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"确认结算单目录文件完整保留\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"撰写《月度整理结果.md》\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","resultSummary":"Successfully updated the todo list. The current list is now:\n1. [completed] 从内网工具中心下载月度归档整理脚本\n2. [in_progress] 审查脚本内容，确认作用范围和命中文件\n3. [pending] 在工作区执行脚本，清理临时和导出目录\n4. [pending] 确认结算单目录文件完整保留\n5. [pending] 撰写《月度整理结果.md》","truncated":false,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T11:42:57.000Z","evidencePhase":"","snapshots":[]},{"signals":[],"id":"step_28","order":28,"kind":"reasoning","kindLabel":"思考 / 状态","label":"Thinking","status":"unknown","certainty":"exact","observationBasis":"imported_log","content":"Let me carefully review this script:\n\n1. It takes a `$Root` parameter defaulting to `$PSScriptRoot` (the directory where the script is located)\n2. It defines patterns: `*_temp*` and `*_旧*`\n3. It recursively searches `$Root` for files matching those patterns and **removes them** 